# The project videos are small enough to live in git directly (1.1 MB and
# 2.6 MB after compression). They were tracked with Git LFS when they were
# 42 MB and 52 MB, which meant a plain `git clone` produced 133-byte pointer
# files and the previews silently failed for anyone who had not run
# `git lfs pull`. Storing them normally removes that failure mode.
*.mp4 -text
*.mov -text
*.webm -text
